949194823519322.wav"},"biligame":{"zh":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4c/0gp7kllh442o98mhmlkdq8ptjef6wqk.ogg"}},"line":5},{"title":"关于法尔伽·陌生","title_en":"About Varka: Stranger","text":"法尔伽？不认识…","text_en":"Unlocks at Friendship Lv. 4Varka? Razor doesn't know...","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/120815d56f065688b9053641d5ce2dbf_374277507896658212.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/8b6b1bcb1c4b218c4e756113eedbb52f_6197412705001119061.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/64366be68ebfdff9aa3e0045e2080817_2635035845244012287.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/e20e99564e75e018ad37c91d6196b7d5_7449103609552174959.wav"},"biligame":{"zh":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/37/snypedxdalmvmgylre7n4wui820z9wq.ogg"}},"line":6},{"title":"关于法尔伽·回忆","title_en":"About Varka: Memory","text":"哦…法尔伽，是名字。那个男人，高大。雷泽名字，铁的爪子，他给的。唔…想见他。","text_en":"Unlocks at Friendship Lv. 6Oh, Varka is... a name. That man big. Big steelclaw, Razor's name — Varka gave him. Oh... want to see him.","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/ffc0ed07e56a318ebb410f0663184f41_5344962320440123857.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/b140752a4f28d9f837e8342855c07cd3_5441495629161296637.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/648ac80fb1a434b4f2a11df389fbb09e_3787638030670346298.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/a8ffe5559413198fd9593849686101a2_3116370892683554897.wav"},"biligame":{"zh":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9c/ockexv30udrdp425jjx79jf2bi53erm.ogg"}},"line":7},{"title":"想要了解雷泽·其一","title_en":"More About Razor: I","text":"你的气味，善良的味道。喜欢吃肉？","text_en":"*sniff* Hmm... You smell kind. Do you like meat?","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/eee51b9bc7cafe54926961b0c2b1db56_1290156568477675211.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/704a482237111e809a00325275946b96_3421458987262814589.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/a0225492213830b3cb5420d298242eba_2740909099420196206.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/521efbc4401b2989f9ce8cf1be024893_1585223866666813021.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解雷泽·其二","title_en":"More About Razor: II","text":"你很强。和狼一样强。喜欢和你狩猎。收获很多。","text_en":"Unlocks at Friendship Lv. 3You are strong. Like a wolf. I like to hunt with you. We catch a lot.","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/13a6586599bd4db483984264e9d61889_8740264360560246866.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/af6600b4bb3dd5a1fae9af7ff51b29c1_4007580571427605360.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/168ec81a303a7c57a076b238774b6f4b_1764165489754421391.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/da7cd9b85b5ca387f7aadf059d1468e0_7842126281803149026.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解雷泽·其三","title_en":"More About Razor: III","text":"卢皮卡是「狼的家」。不对，是「狼的家人」。我的卢皮卡在树林里。它们保护我，说我是卢皮卡。","text_en":"Unlocks at Friendship Lv. 4Lupical means wolf home— no, Lupical means wolf family. My Lupical lives in the woods. They say I am their Lupical.","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/154e7963d3ae0bd6976396e29cb3543d_2363268881266123777.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/bd2b0be7ee32e12b7c1d01678d3d22ae_8708408246167331223.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/346a77536cc45689b086c2ce33aaa3ff_8438575570241765892.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/b1fdc80473ea9635a508d5778b720e4e_347004871679844904.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解雷泽·其四","title_en":"More About Razor: IV","text":"我只有卢皮卡。但是，就算是卢皮卡，我没有四只脚，不是真的狼。有时候心里难过。","text_en":"Unlocks at Friendship Lv. 5My Lupical is my only family. But I don't have four legs, not like them. Because I'm not a real wolf. Sometimes, this makes me sad.","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/eaa537622a778b9a38abff7d3a78f8bd_1685445963625654754.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/1b7dbba05e0e2bb43a3416d5f285b256_6204028254022364764.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/fa1c7182e8277f924789991a604d45fd_9179614900651620424.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/7debc1f95f42807d0b9bc9c7c3e60e62_6850919584212422253.wav"}},"line":null},{"title":"想要了解雷泽·其五","title_en":"More About Razor: V","text":"和你一起奔跑开心，和你一起狩猎开心。和你一起，我是狼，我是人，都没关系。你是朋友，你是我的「卢皮卡」。我想要你也开心。","text_en":"Unlocks at Friendship Lv. 6When I run with you, when I hunt with you, I am happy. With you, I am not a wolf, I am not a boy, I am just me. I am Razor. Because you are my friend. You are my Lupical. I hope you feel happy, too!","audios":{"hoyolab":{"zh":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/14a9e1840105307cb80a0a98a14f09ed_6052283729382875715.wav","en":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/a6d8f6ab34631a18875f26255f55f78c_2383453382516460331.wav","ja":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki-voice/2022/11/12/47826599/b83018dd98bf317b8dac8e295e0709f9_6073693335055985105.wav","ko":"https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki